@startuml offering-boundary
title Offering Boundary ; per ADR-ES-021 section 11

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Offering" as O
class "Product" as P
class "Service" as S
class "Capability" as Cap
class "Value Stream" as VS
class "Enterprise" as E
class "Customer Need" as CN
class "Fulfillment Process" as FP

O -[dotted]- P : is NOT
O -[dotted]- S : is NOT
O -[dotted]- Cap : is NOT
O -[dotted]- VS : is NOT
O -[dotted]- E : is NOT
O -[dotted]- CN : is NOT
O -[dotted]- FP : is NOT

P -[dotted]- O : is NOT
S -[dotted]- O : is NOT
Cap -[dotted]- O : is NOT
VS -[dotted]- O : is NOT
E -[dotted]- O : is NOT

note right
  Per ADR-ES-021 section 11 (Rejected Interpretations):
  Offering is NOT Product, Service, Capability, Value Stream,
  Enterprise, Customer Need, or Fulfillment Process.
  Reverse direction also rejected.
end note

@enduml
